<title>UK: Sigma Finance ups Nov 2001 bond to 400 mln Sfr.</title>
<headline>Sigma Finance ups Nov 2001 bond to 400 mln Sfr.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SIGMA FINANCE</p>
<p> AMT  **400 MLN CHF   COUPON     3.25	MATURITY    29.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  103.65    PAY DATE    10.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  =	   LISTING    EBS	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	PLUS 101 DAYS ACCRUED INTEREST</p>
<p>		**REOPENING OF 300 MLN CHF ISSUE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
